# Keys swapped in the menu ; (fixtures/keymapcase.keymap.toml, a real
# user's file, docs/keymap.md "Menus"): each row keeps the place of its
# action, whatever key it takes, and a capital is another key than its
# lower case (c Deleted, C Contacts).
key ;
expect menu_rows ~ c Deleted
expect menu_rows ~ C Contacts
# Contacts among the screens, before Tags and Groups, not after History.
expect menu_rows ~ C Contacts | T Tags | G Groups
snap menu
key C
expect screen = contacts
key esc
key ;
key c
expect folder = Deleted
key ;
key E
expect folder = Everything
key ;
key G
expect screen = groups
